" data-link="guides" style="--hue: 178"&gt;guide&lt;/a&gt; and look back on the &lt;a class="tablink" href="https://fisharefriends.org/categories/fish/" data-link="fish" style="--hue: 275"&gt;fish&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="tablink" href="https://fisharefriends.org/categories/friends/" data-link="friends" style="--hue: 30"&gt;friends&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class="tablink" href="https://fisharefriends.org/categories/water/" data-link="water" style="--hue: 215"&gt;waters&lt;/a&gt; you met along the way.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;See you on the water :)&lt;span class="arrow"&gt;&amp;#8288;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;critty&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>guides</title><link>https://fisharefriends.org/guides/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://fisharefriends.org/guides/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>